1093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDYueJQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:43:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:43:28Z","body":"> I dunno if this is intentional or not, but if you're hovering an item, it will take selection priority over the search.\r\n\r\nI didn't intend for this, but it might make sense to have it behave this way to allow for mixed keyboard/mouse usage scenarios.\r\n\r\nTo give a comparison, GitHub label dropdowns don't work this way. Instead, they always toggle the first search result when pressing <kbd>Enter</kbd>, even with no search term entered.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4522221093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4786851356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119613#issuecomment-4786851356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/